  <!-- Two families of conditions -->
  <section id="families" class="section bg-paper" aria-labelledby="families-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-start">
        <h2 id="families-h" class="h2 lg:col-span-7">Two families of conditions, one way of testing</h2>
        <p class="lead lg:col-span-5">Every test works the same way: a spot of blood on a card, no DNA extraction, a modest laboratory. What differs is the condition.</p>
      </div>
      <ul class="families mt-12">
        <li id="haemoglobinopathies">
          <h3 class="h3">Haemoglobinopathies</h3>
          <p>Inherited disorders of haemoglobin. They are India's most common single-gene conditions, and most families learn of them only after an affected child is born.</p>
          <p>Carrier screening, diagnosis and newborn screening, from the same card.</p>
          <p class="label">Tests</p>
          <ul class="family-tests">
            <li>LitLife™-SCA</li>
            <li>LitLife™-SiBThal217</li>
            <li>LitLife™-BThal</li>
            <li>LitLife™-AlphaThal</li>
            <li>HbD and HbE testing</li>
          </ul>
          <ul class="family-links">
            <li>{{ pageLink("/solutions/sickle-cell-anaemia/", "Sickle cell anaemia") }}</li>
            <li>{{ pageLink("/solutions/thalassaemia/", "Thalassaemia and other haemoglobinopathies") }}</li>
          </ul>
        </li>
        <li id="musculopathies">
          <h3 class="h3">Musculopathies</h3>
          <p>Inherited conditions that weaken the muscles. Children are often thought to be weak or undernourished, and families wait years for a diagnosis.</p>
          <p>A genetic result ends the wait, opens the treatment that exists, and tells the family who else carries the condition.</p>
          <p class="label">Tests</p>
          <ul class="family-tests">
            <li>LitLife™-SMA</li>
            <li>DMD test</li>
            <li>LGMD test</li>
          </ul>
          <ul class="family-links">
            <li>{{ pageLink("/solutions/spinal-muscular-atrophy/", "Spinal muscular atrophy") }}</li>
            <li>{{ pageLink("/solutions/develop-a-test/#musculopathies", "Duchenne muscular dystrophy") }}</li>
            <li>{{ pageLink("/solutions/develop-a-test/#musculopathies", "Limb-girdle muscular dystrophy") }}</li>
          </ul>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Developed so far: the home page's rows -->
  <section id="developed" class="section" aria-labelledby="developed-h">
