  <!-- What a solution includes -->
  <section id="what-you-get" class="section" aria-labelledby="what-you-get-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 id="what-you-get-h" class="h2 max-w-[44rem]">What you get when we work together</h2>
      <ul class="rows mt-10">
        <li>
          <h3>A test developed for the condition</h3>
          <p>An assay built and validated for what your programme needs to detect.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>A sample that can be taken anywhere</h3>
          <p>A spot of blood on a card, carried at room temperature. Collection is simple and minimally invasive.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>A method your laboratory can run</h3>
          <p>Written for laboratories with minimal infrastructure, with no DNA extraction step.*</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Training for the people who run it</h3>
          <p>Hands-on workshops for laboratory staff and health workers.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>A way to watch the programme</h3>
          <p>Test details captured on a mobile app, for real-time monitoring.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Help with what follows a result</h3>
          <p>Genetic and social counselling for patients and carriers, awareness programmes, and patient support groups.</p>
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p class="footnote">* Where applicable for developed assays.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

